Enhancement: Add per-pack unused prune options

Adds two new arguments to the prune command, which allow for selecting pack to prune
based on the percentage of the pack's contents that are unused. `--max-pack-unused`
sets an upper bound, above which all pack files are repacked, and `--ignore-pack-unsed`
sets a lower bound, below which pack files are not repacked. Between these bounds,
packs are repacked based on the value for `--max-unused`.

